  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Удаляет надпись Java Edition под логотипом «Minecraft» на главном экране!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1502432/description_8ec46446-f737-45db-94b9-7a735ac2bb0b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1502432/description_84825e8f-ae40-4eaf-bcda-3e902124442c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Также работает с другими ресурспаками!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1502432/description_f208475f-7139-46e1-9774-778d3623960c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"289\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1502432/description_a25a665f-63ee-4b04-9789-64a0658d2d89.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"289\"></p>",
